<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's FCW 6-mth net up fourfold.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's FCW 6-mth net up fourfold.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   4.90   vs	   1.12</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  3.0    vs	   1.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    42.60   vs	  63.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     8.75   vs	   3.75</p>
<p>    Minorities	    less 0.58   vs    less 0.78</p>
<p>    Dividend			-     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's FCW Holdings Bhd makes cables and is involved in telecommunications apart from other businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
